==Icelandic==
===Alternative spellings===
*[[hvað segirðu]]
===Etymology===
From ''[[hvað]]'' meaning "[[what]]" + ''[[segir]]'' meaning "you [[say]]" the second person form of the verb ''[[segja]]'' meaning "to [[say]]" + ''[[þú]]'' meaning "[[you]]". Literally meaning "what say you?".
===Phrase===
'''[[hvað]] [[segja#Icelandic|segir]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]?'''

# [[how are you]]?
#: '''''Hvað segir þú'''? - [[Allt gott]], [[takk fyrir]].''
#:: '''How are you?''' - I'm fine, thanks. 

